          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio malaika owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Elicha ali, “Yiikha asi ne naye. Okhamuria tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Elicha enyokha mala ekha ne naye bacha khubona omwami. Elicha aboolela Ahasia ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areeba ali, ‘Siina sikila ne waruma barumwa khureeba Baali-sebubu, wele owa Ekironi? Sikila wibaasia oli Wele mu Isiraeli mbamo tawe niye onyala wareeba likhuwa? Nono se olarura khu sitaanda nikhwo okonile tawe. Ng'ali olafwa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
